# Sweep Along Path round a closed path out of a plane with sharp
# corners: a square swept round four lines in 3d, no two sides in one
# plane, picked with the mouse; the frames come back turned, so the
# sweep is fitted and the turn taken out between the mitred corners. The
# group screen, then the solid checked.
file $testdata/ui/sweep_skew.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view other
click-entity 40000
click-entity 50000
click-entity 60000
click-entity 70000
menu Features|Sweep Along Path
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
